Node ID=952 Mollified Mayor
Text=Actually, this town is less dependent on that blue lummox than I originally let on. I...suppose I will allow him to stay if he stops his habitual lying. Please do what you can to deal with the titans, but they are not the most immediate threat facing this town. If you plan on facing the titans, have a word with Brother Michel before you leave. He was a great warrior and may be able to help you or at least offer advice.
