Text=<The mayor sits down without being invited to.> Gone. Gone where, exactly -- home, or down the valley towards us? No. No, forgive me. If they are gone then Montaillou is spared and I am grateful, and I shall have a mass said for Toulouse. And I shall say nothing whatever about deals or bargains, and neither, I hope, will you. A man in office says a great many things in a bad month.
